&lt;p&gt;Local 420 IUOE:&amp;#160; 5.2% effective to April 17, 2025; 4.0% scheduled April 17, 2026.&amp;#160; &amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Local 510 IBEW:&amp;#160; 2.9% effective March 1, 2026.&lt;span style="white-space: pre;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</ferc:DisclosureOfEstimatedAnnualEffectAndNatureOfAnyImportantWageScaleChangesTextBlock>
