    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" xlink:from="HH35A3811732D74BFD44B61E96972A2CB9" xlink:to="HH7CAEC8B91E91E4862FDC3A86121A76CD" order="1" />
    <link:loc xlink:type="locator" xlink:href="#HH5CFED411B0A06BD02C9F8BE2AD71F488" xlink:label="HH5CFED411B0A06BD02C9F8BE2AD71F488" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="HHEF3479845558862FFEBDB4EFC0024A5F" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <p>332 L1a</p>
        <p>Network transmission is billed by ATC (billing agent), but it is reported under MISO since MISO is the transmission provider; ATC acts as the billing agent in order to facilitate the billing process.</p>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" xlink:from="HH5CFED411B0A06BD02C9F8BE2AD71F488" xlink:to="HHEF3479845558862FFEBDB4EFC0024A5F" order="1" />
    <link:loc xlink:type="locator" xlink:href="#HHC5088E18093DCF6EFD227BF4F9FB334D" xlink:label="HHC5088E18093DCF6EFD227BF4F9FB334D" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="HH86CDB683CE2621D79F5313C8FA6F8CA7" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <p>332 L1g</p>
        <p>Other charges consist of Schedule 26 (Network Upgrade), Schedule 26A (Multi-Value Project Cost Recovery), Schedule 26D (Cost Recovery for Targeted Market Efficiency Projhects-PJM), Schedule 26E (Cost Recover for Interregional Market Efficiency Projects), Schedule 33 (Blackstart Service), Unreserved Use Revenue.</p>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" xlink:from="HHC5088E18093DCF6EFD227BF4F9FB334D" xlink:to="HH86CDB683CE2621D79F5313C8FA6F8CA7" order="1" />
    <link:loc xlink:type="locator" xlink:href="#HHDF6869013512EB3A85257390ABF1C85C" xlink:label="HHDF6869013512EB3A85257390ABF1C85C" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="HHE5A781E0785F5F766045648B63406FB4" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <p>332 L2g</p>
        <p>Other charges consist of amounts for amortization of Regulatory Assets and Regulatory Liability dollars per the PSCW Rate Order.</p>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" xlink:from="HHDF6869013512EB3A85257390ABF1C85C" xlink:to="HHE5A781E0785F5F766045648B63406FB4" order="1" />
    <link:loc xlink:type="locator" xlink:href="#HH2459FC06270C958BFA726421FCB0A75B" xlink:label="HH2459FC06270C958BFA726421FCB0A75B" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="HH8B381333313525EDA703E33677976E30" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <p>300 L6b</p>
        <p>Unmetered sales of outdoor overhead and ornamental lighting service for MWh sales are based on the size of units times number of burning hours in a year. Revenues are derived on a charge per fixture by class of service.</p>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" xlink:from="HH2459FC06270C958BFA726421FCB0A75B" xlink:to="HH8B381333313525EDA703E33677976E30" order="1" />
    <link:loc xlink:type="locator" xlink:href="#HH758BDA2145DDCA2671E4199E034485DF" xlink:label="HH758BDA2145DDCA2671E4199E034485DF" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="HHFFFF76476BF156B5DCBAA4FE0209895D" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <p>300 L12b</p>
        <p>Includes $ (1,446,199) of unbilled revenues.</p>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" xlink:from="HH758BDA2145DDCA2671E4199E034485DF" xlink:to="HHFFFF76476BF156B5DCBAA4FE0209895D" order="1" />
    <link:loc xlink:type="locator" xlink:href="#HH9598C4BD59A4F47A57B832753A79FBC4" xlink:label="HH9598C4BD59A4F47A57B832753A79FBC4" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="HH66F85713C2C56A0FF122CFAECF5A507E" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <p>300 L6d</p>
        <p>Unmetered sales of outdoor overhead and ornamental lighting service for MWh sales are based on the size of units times number of burning&#160;hours in a year. Revenues are derived on a charge per fixture by class of service.</p>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" xlink:from="HH9598C4BD59A4F47A57B832753A79FBC4" xlink:to="HH66F85713C2C56A0FF122CFAECF5A507E" order="1" />
    <link:loc xlink:type="locator" xlink:href="#HH15D5B9EE8AAC1CEC722A98B8F11DA1D7" xlink:label="HH15D5B9EE8AAC1CEC722A98B8F11DA1D7" />
